  "Code & schemas — MIT": "Code & Schema — MIT",
  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Code nhwɛso, JSON Schemas, ne mmara nsiesiei a mfiri tumi kenkan no, wɔde MIT Laesens na ama, gye sɛ wɔaka ɔkwan foforɔ. Wobɛtumi de asi wo ankasa saet so kwa.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Hokwan Kwan A Wɔaka Abom",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Aguadi Mu Nkyekyɛ Bio",
  "Commercial use": "Aguadi Mu Dwumadie",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Aguadi Mu Dwumadie Hia Sɛ Wɔfrɛ",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Wɔhyɛɛ saa ahofadi amanneɛbɔ krataa yi, wɔ Bletchley AI Banbɔ Nhyiamu Kɛseɛ akyi, a Yoshua Bengio di anim, a nhwehwɛmufoɔ boro ɔha (100) a wɔfiri aman bɛyɛ aduasa (30) mu, ka UN, OECD ne EU ho, boaeɛ. Ɛboaboa nyansahu a ɛfa AI a wɔabɔ mu tumi ne asiane ho ano — na ɛka sɛ nhyehyɛe bi seesei betumi ahu sɛ wɔresɔ wɔn ahwɛ, na wɔsesa wɔn suban ho.",
  "Companion media": "Mfoni ne Nnyegyeɛ a Ɛka Ho",
