  "Transform": "Sesa",
  "Transformation": "Nsakraeɛ",
  "Turns declared rights into executable licensing: quote, pay, verify, audit, revoke.": "Sesa Hokwan A Wɔaka No Ma Ɛyɛ Laesens A Wɔde Di Dwuma Ankasa: Quote, Akatua, Sɔhwɛ, Nsrahwɛ, Twa-Mu.",
  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "Kasa Aduonu Na Ɛwɔ Hɔ Seesei Nyinaa Mu: English, Chinese Tete, Chinese A Wɔatwa Mu, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.",
  "Two license tiers: a free public tier and a contact-based commercial tier.": "Laesens Gyinabea Mmienu: Deɛ Ɛyɛ Kwa Ma Ɔman Nyinaa, Ne Aguadi Mu Deɛ A Ɛgyina Frɛ So.",
  "UI": "Adwuma-Anim (UI)",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Ahotoɔ A Wɔnkyerɛ Mu Pefee No, AI Adwuma Akwan Fa No Sɛ Mmara Mu Ntɛtɛ Na Wɔyi Gu; Ho Kwan A Wɔde Protokol Akyekyere A Mfiri Tumi Kenkan Nko Ara Na Ɛma Nsɛm Yɛ Deɛ Wɔbɛtumi Asua Ankasa.",
