  "Verified in both LTR and RTL contexts: the panel mirrors correctly for Arabic and Persian without any special-casing, using logical CSS positioning.": "Wɔasɔ Ahwɛ Wɔ LTR Ne RTL Nyinaa Mu: Panel No Yɛ Ne Ho Sɛ Ahwehwɛmu Pɛpɛɛpɛ Ma Arabic Ne Persian A Soronko Biara Nhia, Denam Logical CSS Nhyehyɛe So.",
