  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts.": "Saet Yi Ne Ne Protokol Drafte Version Abakɔsɛm.",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts. Breaking spec changes are recorded here.": "Saet Yi Ne Ne Protokol Drafte Version Abakɔsɛm. Nsakraeɛ A Ɛbɛsɛe Biribi Wɔ Nkyerɛkyerɛmu Mu No, Wɔatwerɛ Wɔ Ha.",
  "Versioned specifications, JSON Schemas, and the policy files actually deployed on this site. Every file can be downloaded, validated, and cited directly.": "Nkyerɛkyerɛmu A Version Wɔ Ho, JSON Schemas, Ne Mmara Nkrataa A Wɔde Asi Saet Yi So Ankasa. Wɔbɛtumi Atwe Krataa Biara Afa, Wɔasɔ Ahwɛ, Na Wɔde Ayɛ Adanseɛ Tee.",
  "Versioning": "Version Ho Nhyehyɛe",
  "Versions": "Version Ahodoɔ",
  "Video and audio companions to the protocols and papers — the AI rights layer, watchable and listenable.": "Mfoni-Kanea Ne Nnyegyeɛ A Ɛka Protokol Ne Nkrataa No Ho — AI Hokwan Mpaemu, A Wɔbɛtumi Ahwɛ Na Wɔatie.",
  "Videos": "Mfoni-Kanea",
  "Want to generate your own policy file?": "Wopɛ Sɛ Woyɛ Wo Ankasa Mmara Krataa Anaa?",
  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Wɔkɔfa Wɛb Fonts Firi Google Fonts, A Ɛnya Font Abisadeɛ A Ɛda Hɔ Firi Wo Browser Mu. Wɔmfa Script Foforɔ Biara A Ɛfiri Ɔfoforɔ Nkyɛn Nnyɛ Adwuma.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Deɛ AI Nhyehyɛe Betumi De Nsɛm Ayɛ: Akenkan, Ntwatiaa, Nsakraeɛ, Sanfa, Ntetee, Aguadi Mu Dwumadie, Nkyekyɛ Bio. AICR Mmara Ne AICL Laesens Mpaemu Ma Saa Hokwan Yi Yɛ Deɛ Wɔbɛtumi Aka Na Wɔde Adi Aguadi.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Deɛ Server Betumi Asan Ama Sɛ AI Crawler Bisa Nsɛm A Laesens Wɔ Ho Nanso Laesens Token Nni Ho — Quote A Mfiri Tumi De Di Dwuma Sen Sɛ Awieeɛ A Biribiara Nni Mu.",
  "What this site is": "Deɛ Saet Yi Yɛ",
  "What this site is not": "Deɛ Saet Yi Nyɛ",
  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "Sɛ AI Betumi Asua Anaa, Ɛkɔ Mmɛ Dɛn, Ma Botaeɛ Bɛn, Ne Nsɛyɛdeɛ Bɛn So. Sɛ Wɔakenkan Adeɛ Bi Nkyerɛ Sɛ Wɔasua Afiri Mu; 'Wɔammara Ho Kwan' Nkyerɛ 'Wɔbɛtumi Asua'. AIRS Ne AILP Sesa Adesua-Ho-Kwan Ma Ɛyɛ Spectrum A Ɛkorɔn Nkakrankakra, A Mfiri Tumi Kenkan.",
  "Whitepapers": "Nkrataa Nhwehwɛmu",
  "Whitepapers & Docs": "Nkrataa Nhwehwɛmu & Nkrataa",
  "Whitepapers remain English-first by design; machine-readable files stay language-neutral.": "Nkrataa Nhwehwɛmu Da So Ara Yɛ English-Kane Sɛnea Wɔhyehyɛeɛ; Nkrataa A Mfiri Tumi Kenkan Da So Ara Nkyea Kasa Biara Ho.",
  "Who is behind it": "Hwan Na Ɔwɔ Akyi",
  "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections": "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections",
  "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics": "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics",
  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Nea Enti 'Aane/Daabi' Baako Ntumi Nhwɛ AI Mmerɛ Nsɛm Mu Dwumadie So — Ne Sɛnea Hokwan Mpaemu Bɛyɛ Mmom.",
  "Why undefined openness gets cleaned out of training pipelines": "Nea Enti Ahotoɔ A Wɔnkyerɛ Mu Pefee No Wɔyi Firi Ntetee Adwuma Akwan Mu",
  "Wilks, Ladak, and Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argue that philosophical debate over AI consciousness overlooks psychological research on animal ethics — the same cognitive and social biases that limit moral consideration for animals will likely limit it for AI too, regardless of whether AI ever becomes conscious.": "Wilks, Ladak, Ne Loughnan (University Of Edinburgh) Ka Sɛ Nyansapɛ Akyinnyeɛ A Ɛfa AI Adwenhunu Ho No Mfa Nyansahu Nhwehwɛmu A Ɛfa Mmoa Ɔbra Pa Ho Nhyia — Adwene Ne Ɔmanfoɔ Mu Nsusuiɛ A Ɛtia Koro No Ara A Ɛma Mmoa Nnya Suban Tebea No, Ɛbɛtia AI Nso, Sɛ AI Bɛnya Adwenhunu Anaa Ɔrennya Mpo.",
  "You are leaving AGIRight.org": "Woresi AGIRight.org Akyi",
