  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "“Protocolized Openness” Wɔahyɛ Mu Den Sɛ Ɛyɛ Krataa A Wɔde English Kasa Twerɛeɛ (A Chinese Nkyerɛwee Bi Ka Ho Nkyɛn Nkyɛn) — Wɔnhyɛɛ Nhyɛso Sɛ Wɔbɛkyerɛ Ase Soronko.",
